{
  "dsl": "octos.lesson",
  "version": "0.1",
  "profile": "authoring",
  "lesson": {
    "mode": "explain",
    "language": "zh-CN",
    "title": "偏导数：固定输入，求截线斜率",
    "goals": [
      "理解求对x的偏导数时需保持变量y固定为常数y₀",
      "认识三维曲面在y=y₀截面上的交线是一元函数曲线z=g(x)",
      "明确偏导数几何意义是截线在特定点处的切线斜率"
    ],
    "adaptation": {
      "strategies": [
        "承接上一课固定z等高线的思路，通过固定y引入垂直截面",
        "通过3D曲面截线与2D平面截线切线对照，建立直观到代数的联系",
        "借反例说明偏导数是否依赖y₀与函数具体形式相关"
      ]
    },
    "variables": [
      {
        "as": "number_01",
        "initial": 0,
        "min": 0,
        "max": 2,
        "label": "截面位置y₀",
        "control": {
          "kind": "slider",
          "step": 0.01
        }
      }
    ],
    "tasks": [
      {
        "as": "section-03-task-01",
        "prompt": "对于曲面 z = x² + y²，当固定 x = 1 时，截线方程为 z = 1 + y²。请将截面位置 y₀ 调节至目标值，使得截线上的高度 z 正好等于 2。",
        "availability": {
          "kind": "after_lesson"
        },
        "hints": [
          "利用方程 2 = 1 + y₀² 进行计算",
          "移项可得 y₀² = 1",
          "题目要求非负的 y₀ 值"
        ],
        "hint_after_attempts": 2,
        "success_message": "回答正确！当 x=1、y₀=1 时，高度 z = 1² + 1² = 2。",
        "allowed_operations": [
          {
            "kind": "variable_change",
            "variable": "number_01",
            "controls": [
              "slider"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "completion": {
          "kind": "expression_target",
          "expression": "number_01",
          "value": 1,
          "tolerance": 0.005
        },
        "start": {
          "kind": "practice",
          "variables": [
            "number_01"
          ]
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "key": "section-01",
      "purpose": "建立固定y=y₀的垂直截面几何模型与概念引入",
      "beats": [
        {
          "key": "moment-01",
          "say": "上一课我们固定高度z研究了等高线。今天我们要研究对x的偏导数，方法是保持另一个输入变量y固定不变，设y等于常数y₀。",
          "delivery": "patient",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-01-item-01",
              "kind": "math",
              "role": "derivation",
              "content": {
                "latex": "z = f(x, y) = x^2 + y^2 \\quad (y = y_0)"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "new_region",
                "region_role": "section-01"
              },
              "when": "before_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-02",
          "say": "请看三维函数曲面图，我们建立曲面z等于x平方加y平方。同时插入一面垂直于y轴的截面，当前截面位置y₀设为0。",
          "delivery": "neutral",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-02-item-01",
              "kind": "scene3d",
              "role": "main_visual",
              "content": {
                "title": "曲面与垂直截面 (y=y₀)",
                "fallback": "函数曲面 z=x^2 + y^2 与可变截面。",
                "axes": true,
                "camera": {
                  "yaw": 0.72,
                  "pitch": 0.55,
                  "zoom": 1
                },
                "objects": [
                  {
                    "as": "surface",
                    "kind": "surface",
                    "label": "z=x^2 + y^2",
                    "color": "teal",
                    "expression": "x^2 + y^2",
                    "x_range": {
                      "min": -2,
                      "max": 2
                    },
                    "y_range": {
                      "min": -2,
                      "max": 2
                    },
                    "samples": 12
                  }
                ],
                "sections": [
                  {
                    "as": "section",
                    "axis": "y",
                    "value": 0,
                    "targets": [
                      "surface"
                    ],
                    "display": "plane_and_intersection",
                    "label": "截面",
                    "color": "orange"
                  }
                ],
                "bindings": [
                  {
                    "target": "section.value",
                    "expression": "number_01"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "new_region",
                "region_role": "section-01"
              },
              "when": "during_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "focus",
              "targets": [
                "section-01-moment-02-item-01"
              ],
              "intent": "观察垂直截面与曲面的交线",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-03",
          "say": "在这个截面上，y始终保持为0不能改变，而x可以在截面内自由变化，高度z则随着x的变化而变化。这就是研究对x偏导数的几何框架。",
          "delivery": "emphatic",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-03-item-01",
              "kind": "note",
              "role": "explanation",
              "content": {
                "title": "截面约束条件",
                "items": [
                  "输入变量 y 固定为常数 y₀",
                  "输入变量 x 可自由变化",
                  "输出高度 z 仅随 x 变化：z = g(x)"
                ]
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-01-moment-02-item-01"
              },
              "when": "after_speech"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "section-02",
      "purpose": "平移截面至y₀=1并绘制截线与2D切线对照图表",
      "beats": [
        {
          "key": "moment-01",
          "say": "现在我把截面位置 y₀ 从 0 平移到 1。请注意，平移截面只是在选择我们要研究哪一条截线，平移本身并不是对 x 求导。",
          "delivery": "patient",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "animate",
              "variable": "number_01",
              "value": 1,
              "easing": "linear",
              "duration_intent": "normal",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-02",
          "say": "当固定 y 等于 1 时，代入原曲面得到一元截线方程 g(x) 等于 x 平方加 1。若取 x₀ 等于 1，则对应空间点 P 为 (1, 1, 2)。",
          "delivery": "emphatic",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-02-moment-02-item-01",
              "kind": "math",
              "role": "derivation",
              "content": {
                "latex": "y_0=1 \\implies z=g(x)=x^2+1, \\quad P=(1,1,2)"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-01-moment-02-item-01"
              },
              "when": "after_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-02-moment-02-item-02",
              "kind": "math",
              "role": "derivation",
              "content": {
                "latex": "g'(1)=\\left.\\frac{\\partial z}{\\partial x}\\right|_{(1,1)}=2"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-02-moment-02-item-01"
              },
              "when": "after_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-03",
          "say": "我们建立二维平面函数图，其中横轴表示 x，纵轴表示高度 z。图中标注了截线与在点 P 处斜率为 2 的切线，可以看到切线与抛物线精准相切。",
          "delivery": "patient",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-02-moment-03-item-01",
              "kind": "plot",
              "role": "supporting_visual",
              "content": {
                "title": "y₀=1 截面截线与切线图 (纵轴表示高度z)",
                "axes": {
                  "x": {
                    "min": -4,
                    "max": 4,
                    "label": "x"
                  },
                  "y": {
                    "min": -15,
                    "max": 20,
                    "label": "z"
                  }
                },
                "curves": [
                  {
                    "as": "primary-curve",
                    "expression": "((x)^(2))+(1)",
                    "label": "截线 z=x²+1"
                  },
                  {
                    "as": "curve-02",
                    "expression": "(2)*(x)",
                    "label": "P处切线 z=2x"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "right_of",
                "anchor": "section-02-moment-02-item-02"
              },
              "when": "before_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "focus",
              "targets": [
                "section-01-moment-02-item-01",
                "section-02-moment-03-item-01"
              ],
              "intent": "比较截线与切线在点P(1,2)的相切关系",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "section-03",
      "purpose": "推导切线方程与偏导数公式，揭示几何斜率本质与边界",
      "beats": [
        {
          "key": "moment-01",
          "say": "我们对截线函数求导。截线的高度等于 x 的平方加一，所以它的导数等于二乘以 x。在 x 等于一的位置，导数值就是二。",
          "delivery": "patient",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-03-moment-01-item-01",
              "kind": "math",
              "role": "derivation",
              "content": {
                "latex": "g'(x) = 2x \\implies g'(1) = 2"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-02-moment-03-item-01"
              },
              "when": "during_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "focus",
              "targets": [
                "section-02-moment-03-item-01"
              ],
              "intent": "关注截线函数在x=1处的求导结果",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-02",
          "say": "切点的横坐标是一，高度是二，切线斜率也是二。根据点斜式，高度 z 减二，等于二乘以 x 减一，整理得到 z 等于二乘以 x。这里的斜率二，表示高度增量与 x 增量的极限比值，不是用量角器在屏幕上量出的角度。",
          "delivery": "emphatic",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-03-moment-02-item-01",
              "kind": "note",
              "role": "explanation",
              "content": {
                "title": "截线切线与偏导数",
                "items": [
                  "切点: (1, 2)",
                  "点斜式: z - 2 = 2(x - 1) => z = 2x",
                  "斜率本质: 瞬时变化率 lim(Δx→0) Δz/Δx，非视觉角度",
                  "一般偏导公式: f_x(x₀, y₀) = 2x₀"
                ]
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-03-moment-01-item-01"
              },
              "when": "during_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "point",
              "target": "section-02-moment-03-item-01",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-03",
          "say": "推广到一般位置，函数 x 的平方加 y 的平方，对 x 的偏导数等于二乘以 x。因此，在指定点处，偏导数等于该点 x 坐标的两倍。这里的结果与 y 坐标无关，是因为固定 y 时，y 的平方是常数，对 x 求导为零。这并不适用于所有曲面。例如函数 x 乘以 y，对 x 的偏导数等于 y，就依赖于 y 的取值。",
          "delivery": "careful",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "focus",
              "targets": [
                "section-02-moment-03-item-01"
              ],
              "intent": "明确偏导数的几何意义与结论适用边界",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "section-04",
      "purpose": "总结固定变量法并完成反求y₀的理解检测与课后应用",
      "beats": [
        {
          "key": "moment-01",
          "say": "总结一下：当我们需要求多元函数对 x 的偏导数时，关键是固定变量 y 等于常数 y₀。此时曲面在截面上的交线变成了关于 x 的一元函数，截线上选定点处的切线斜率就是偏导数。",
          "delivery": "patient",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "focus",
              "targets": [
                "section-03-moment-02-item-01"
              ],
              "intent": "总结固定y求对x偏导数的本质",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-02",
          "say": "请思考便签上的问题：如果我们要在点 P(1,1,2) 处求函数对 y 的偏导数，应该固定哪一个变量？答案是固定 x=1，改沿 y 方向截取曲线。现在请完成课后练习：保持 x=1，找到使曲面高度 z=2 的非负 y₀ 值。",
          "delivery": "encouraging",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-04-moment-02-item-01",
              "kind": "note",
              "role": "explanation",
              "content": {
                "title": "固定变量法总结与思考",
                "items": [
                  "求 ∂z/∂x：固定 y = y₀，研究 z 关于 x 的截线切线斜率",
                  "思考：在 P(1,1,2) 求 ∂z/∂y，应固定哪个变量？",
                  "答：应固定 x = 1，沿着 y 方向截取曲面",
                  "课后应用：保持 x=1，使 z=2，求解非负 y₀"
                ]
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-03-moment-02-item-01"
              },
              "when": "before_speech"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "close": {
    "summary": "本课程讲解了在多元函数z=f(x,y)中，固定y=y₀可得到平行于xz平面的垂直截面与交线z=g(x)。偏导数∂f/∂x即该截线上对应点的切线斜率。",
    "focus": [
      "section-01-moment-02-item-01",
      "section-02-moment-03-item-01"
    ]
  }
}
